## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pathwise Encounters
## Notes: A boss mod for WoW: Forever: boss timers and warnings for Molten Core and Onyxia, the game's own encounter timeline and warnings in the Pathwise look, pull and break timers, and a range check where Forever allows one. Works on its own.
